From 96f76c22680ed8df768c8dfc5bd7587446ac7898 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew Gibson <matthew.gibson041387@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:15:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] Add Emby-style easy pin code for in-network sign-in

Reimplements the easy password feature: a per-user numeric pin stored as
a standard password hash (new EasyPassword column + migration) that is
accepted as an alternative to the full password only for connections in
the local network, gated by the user's EnableLocalPassword setting.
Adds POST /Users/{userId}/EasyPassword to set or clear the pin and
surfaces HasConfiguredEasyPassword in the user dto again.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
